      "summary_en": "Jarvan IV extends his lance, dealing physical damage and lowering the Armor of enemies in its path. Additionally, this will pull Jarvan to his Demacian Standard, knocking up enemies in his path.",
      "summary_zh": "嘉文四世的长矛穿透敌人，对沿途的敌人造成物理伤害和护甲击碎效果。如果嘉文四世该技能指向德邦军旗，那么他将会被导向军旗，并击飞沿途所有敌人。",
